 "description": "$0.01 per call. Pay with x402 (USDC on Base) in _meta[\"x402/payment\"]; MPP (tempo) on the HTTP URL /v1/nonprofit/verify. IRS nonprofit status by EIN or exact organization name: BMF exemption subsection, deductibility and foundation codes, Pub 78 listing, and automatic revocations. Up to 10 records; empty organizations is a paid 200. No legal conclusion is computed.",
